    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\"><strong>Goal</strong><br><br>A network router receives traffic from multiple users. Packet arrivals follow a Poisson process, and overload probabilities are evaluated using a Chernoff bound approximation.<br><br>The router can transmit up to <var>C</var> packets per time slot and has a buffer of size <var>B</var>. Determine the minimum buffer size required to ensure that packet loss probability stays below <var>L</var>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Input</strong><br><br>Line 1:<br><var>n</var> <var>lambda_u</var> <var>C</var> <var>L</var><br><br>- <var>n</var>: number of users<br>- <var>lambda_u</var>: average packet generation rate per user<br>- <var>C</var>: router transmission capacity<br>- <var>L</var>: maximum acceptable packet loss probability</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Output</strong><br><br>Line 1:<br>The minimum integer buffer size <var>B</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><strong>Constraints</strong><br><br>1 &le; <var>n</var> &le; <const>1000</const><br><br>0 &lt; <var>lambda_u</var> &lt; <const>10</const><br><br>1 &le; <var>C</var> &le; <const>1000</const><br><br>0 &lt; <var>L</var> &lt; <const>1</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-